00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:49.430
Oh? I didn't know that this guy
was your friend, Madoka.

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:53.890
I wouldn't know... a guy like this.

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:55.730
Huh...?

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:59.240
Your name is Ayukawa, isn't it?
We're in the same homeroom.

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:02.710
What's that got to do with anything?

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:08.610
I'm not exactly a model student either...

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.680
...but, really, I can't stand stuff like this!

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:17.350
Uh-oh...

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:19.490
Shhh...

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.700
If you start to smoke at a young age...

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:31.770
...you won't be able to have healthy babies!

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:36.040
Ta-da! That showed her, eh?

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:37.680
Think you're somebody special, eh?

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:41.110
Are you man enough to
lecture other people?!

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:44.180
Ow!

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.170
"Ayukawa Madoka...?"

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:03.790
The girl who gave me this hat was...

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:07.530
"What's that got to do with anything?"

00:23:07.630 --> 00:23:09.260
"Think you're somebody special, eh?"

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:11.340
"Are you man enough to
lecture other people?!"

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:17.270
...it was the same girl... wasn't it...?

00:23:56.520 --> 00:24:04.080
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:04.190 --> 00:24:11.650
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:11.770 --> 00:24:27.010
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory.
I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:27.110 --> 00:24:39.620
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:39.730 --> 00:24:49.830
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:49.940 --> 00:24:56.840
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:56.940 --> 00:25:08.290
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:11.960 --> 00:25:14.690
"There's always a drama waiting
just around the corner..."

00:25:14.800 --> 00:25:16.760
...or so someone once said.

00:25:16.860 --> 00:25:19.090
But in my case, that's literally what happened...

00:25:19.200 --> 00:25:21.220
...when I... with Hikaru, a freshman...

00:25:21.340 --> 00:25:23.600
...er... well...

00:25:23.700 --> 00:25:27.440
...ended up kissing, just around the corner.

00:25:27.540 --> 00:25:30.940
Next time: "A Little Lemony Kiss for Her."
